%% title: What a fee structure is made of
%% desc: A fee structure has a name, a fee type, an amount and an academic year. With no class it is for the whole school; with a class it is for all sections of that class; with a section too it is for that section only. When bills are created the amount is copied into the bill.
flowchart LR
  Y["Academic year"]:::admin --> F["Fee structure<br/>name · type · amount"]:::admin
  F --> W["No class:<br/>whole school"]
  F --> C["Class given:<br/>all sections of the class"]
  F --> N["Section given too:<br/>that section only"]
  W --> B["When bills are created<br/>the amount is copied into the bill"]:::note
  C --> B
  N --> B
  classDef admin fill:#fff4e6,stroke:#e8590c,color:#7a2e05
